{"karaoke":[{"c":"I wonder why karaoke is so popular.","cn":"我不知道為什麼卡拉OK如此受歡迎。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #38772 (CK) & #894332 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/38772"},{"c":"Karaoke is good for reducing stress.","cn":"卡拉OK對減輕壓力有益。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #63538 (CK) & #779079 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/63538"}],"keen":[{"c":"Dogs have a keen sense of smell.","cn":"狗的嗅觉灵敏。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #387379 (Mouseneb) & #333227 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/387379"}],"keep":[{"c":"Good students always keep their desk clean.","cn":"好學生總是保持桌面整潔。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #30066 (CM) & #13573449 (LeviHighway)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/30066"},{"c":"I didn't mean to keep it secret.","cn":"我不是有意要保密的。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #254844 (CK) & #4760001 (ryanwoo)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/254844"}],"kettle":[{"c":"The kettle is boiling.","cn":"茶壺沸了。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #324248 (CK) & #9135896 (xjjAstrus)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/324248"}],"key":[{"c":"I found the key underneath the mat.","cn":"我在擦鞋墊下面發現了這把鑰匙。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #255674 (CK) & #805038 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/255674"},{"c":"I have the key to the safe.","cn":"保险箱的钥匙在我这儿。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #934187 (CM) & #934188 (GlossaMatik)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/934187"}],"kick":[{"c":"I get a kick out of life.","cn":"我為人生感到很開心。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #270517 (CK) & #805012 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/270517"},{"c":"You don't have to kick yourself.","cn":"你不要自甘堕落。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #264822 (CM) & #1235651 (sunnywqing)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/264822"}],"kid":[{"c":"We had a kid just last year.","cn":"就在去年我們有了一個孩子。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #19447 (CK) & #796067 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/19447"},{"c":"Who's the smartest kid in your class?","cn":"你班裡最聰明的小孩是誰？","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #9222225 (CK) & #10040459 (verdastelo9604)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/9222225"}],"kill":[{"c":"My father is going to kill me.","cn":"我爸会杀了我的。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #1704221 (CM) & #2065358 (sadhen)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1704221"},{"c":"Why do you want to kill me?","cn":"你們為什麼想殺我？","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #2033296 (CK) & #3701743 (egg0073)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/2033296"}],"kilo":[{"c":"How much does a kilo of bananas cost?","cn":"一公斤香蕉多少錢?","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #7819413 (sharris123) & #789340 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/7819413"}],"kind":[{"c":"A dolphin is a kind of mammal.","cn":"海豚是一種哺乳動物。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #65811 (CK) & #873292 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/65811"},{"c":"I can't stand that kind of politician.","cn":"我不能忍受那種政治家。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #421988 (CK) & #883034 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/421988"}],"kindly":[{"c":"She kindly showed me the way.","cn":"她友善地為我指路。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #315205 (CK) & #765870 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/315205"}],"king":[{"c":"The lion is the king of beasts.","cn":"狮子是万兽之王。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #29839 (CK) & #784072 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/29839"},{"c":"He acts as if he were a king.","cn":"他裝得像國王一樣。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #292954 (CK) & #5780628 (verdastelo9604)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/292954"}],"kingdom":[{"c":"London is the capital of the United Kingdom.","cn":"倫敦是英國的首都。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #2592902 (WestofEden) & #766462 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/2592902"},{"c":"UK is the abbreviation for the United Kingdom.","cn":"UK是英国的缩写。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #1067763 (CM) & #2615108 (fenfang557)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1067763"}],"kiss":[{"c":"I'd never let you kiss me.","cn":"我永远也不会让您亲我。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #4135279 (CK) & #10184244 (slo_oth)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/4135279"},{"c":"She gave him a tender kiss.","cn":"她給了他一個溫柔的吻。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #316334 (CK) & #805593 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/316334"}],"kit":[{"c":"Don't forget to take the first-aid kit.","cn":"别忘了带上急救箱。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #2649680 (sharptoothed) & #5640745 (verdastelo9604)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/2649680"}],"kitchen":[{"c":"I helped my mother in the kitchen.","cn":"我在廚房裡幫媽媽。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #275399 (CK) & #881556 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/275399"},{"c":"I smell something burning in the kitchen.","cn":"我聞到廚房裡有東西燒焦了。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #275403 (CK) & #13556629 (LeviHighway)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/275403"}],"kite":[{"c":"He flew a kite with his son.","cn":"他和他的儿子放风筝了。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #300945 (CK) & #1450516 (asosan)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/300945"},{"c":"Flying a kite can be dangerous.","cn":"放風箏可以是危險的。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #40912 (CK) & #833829 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/40912"}],"kitten":[{"c":"The kitten wants to come in.","cn":"小猫想进来。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #9966318 (DJ_Saidez) & #9963105 (GlossaMatik)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/9966318"},{"c":"The tiger cub looked like a large kitten.","cn":"小老虎看起來像隻大貓。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #36937 (CK) & #772054 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/36937"}],"knack":[{"c":"She has a real knack for getting people to do what she wants.","cn":"她真的有本事让别人做她想做的事。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #640823 (darinmex) & #812249 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/640823"}],"knee":[{"c":"I played with the baby on my knee.","cn":"我在膝蓋上跟嬰兒玩。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #472109 (CK) & #775899 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/472109"},{"c":"The snow was knee deep.","cn":"積雪深及膝蓋。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #272605 (CK) & #778760 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/272605"}],"knife":[{"c":"I have no knife to cut with.","cn":"我沒有刀子可用來切。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #259026 (CK) & #883132 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/259026"},{"c":"It can be used as a knife.","cn":"它可以被當成一把刀來用。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #36547 (CK) & #796968 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/36547"}],"knight":[{"c":"The knight swore an oath of allegiance to the king.","cn":"騎士宣誓效忠於國王。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #25630 (Scott) & #7753622 (Leolaaziano)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/25630"}],"knit":[{"c":"She knit him a sweater.","cn":"她给他织了件毛衣。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #887267 (CK) & #8743955 (crescat)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/887267"},{"c":"Tom likes to knit.","cn":"湯姆喜歡編織。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #37015 (CK) & #825945 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/37015"}],"knob":[{"c":"Turn the knob and open the door.","cn":"轉動門把，把門打開。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #35749 (CK) & #798237 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/35749"}],"knock":[{"c":"I heard a knock at the door.","cn":"我聽到了敲門聲。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #239933 (CK) & #889161 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/239933"},{"c":"Please knock before you come in.","cn":"进来之前请敲门。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #38460 (CK) & #504885 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/38460"}],"know":[{"c":"Did you just get to know him?","cn":"你是不是刚认识他？","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #785437 (hrin) & #784403 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/785437"},{"c":"Do you happen to know his name?","cn":"你說不定知道他的名字？","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #69013 (CK) & #872119 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/69013"}],"knowledge":[{"c":"A little knowledge is a dangerous thing.","cn":"只有一點點的知識是危險的事。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #271877 (CK) & #797043 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/271877"},{"c":"He has a good knowledge of French.","cn":"她很懂法語。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #292621 (CK) & #881205 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/292621"}],"korea":[{"c":"I want to visit South Korea.","cn":"我想访问韩国。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #557329 (CK) & #1446885 (asosan)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/557329"},{"c":"I want to visit Korea.","cn":"我想访问韩国。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #556616 (Pun_intended) & #1446885 (asosan)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/556616"}],"korean":[{"c":"Korean food is generally very spicy.","cn":"韓國菜一般都很辣。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #20812 (keaupuni) & #801315 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/20812"},{"c":"I love Korean food.","cn":"我爱韩国料理。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #399107 (catakaoe) & #399115 (GlossaMatik)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/399107"}]}
